{
    "title": "Exposed 2: Party Lab Edition",
    "description": "Get ready for a hilarious and revealing experience with EXPOSED PARTY LAB: MOST LIKELY TO!\r\n\r\nUncover what your friends truly think about each other in this exciting and laughter-filled exposed party group games.\r\n\r\nDiscover who's up for the craziest dirty challenges in your friend group or couple with a number of different categories ranging from FAMILY, PARTY, COLLEAGUES to SPICY!\r\n\r\nThe game is simple. Add all your friends\u2019 names and wait for them to be EXPOSED!\r\nAnswer questions, do dares and complete challenges.\r\nWith a number of different categories ranging from cheeky, sexy to absurd! This game is sure to turn any time you spend with your friends super fun!\r\nSay goodbye to the old fashioned games of spin the bottle, truth or dare, quizup and cards against humanity! We have more than 5000 challenges and questions so every game night of yours is fresh and fun!\r\nTo have a fun night with EXPOSED , all participants must download the app from the App Store. One player creates the game and invites their friends into the party with the game PIN. Whether you are physically together or connected remotely with friends, you can enjoy Exposed!\r\n\r\nParty Lab offers an array of diverse categories, from humorous and daring to downright absurd! This guarantees an unforgettable time with your friends every time you play. With PARTY LAB's extensive collection of challenges and questions, every game night is a fresh and exhilarating experience as each round exposes new secrets and showcases the true nature of your friendships!\r\n\r\nNow, we bring you even more to boom it:\r\n\r\n- A fresh take on party games\r\n- Over 7000 truths, dares, and challenges\r\n- 5 adaptable game modes for different scenarios (party, spicy, family, dirty, kids, colleagues)\r\n- Various game settings, including mixing categories, question count, timer, anonymous mode, and points-based victory\r\n- An exceptional icebreaker and catalyst for fun interactions\r\n- Perfect couple game\r\n\r\nIn the free mode, you only have access to the \"Get Started\" category with limited questions, and you are also restricted in the game settings. However, with a paid subscription, you gain full access to all categories and game settings without any limitations.\r\n\r\nThe game surpasses the enjoyment of classics like Exploding Kittens 2, Finger Chooser, Picolo, Evil Apples, Exposed, Boomit or Jeopardy.\r\n\r\nContact us partylab.app@gmail.com\r\n\r\nhttps://www.partylab.app/TermsOfUse",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready for a hilarious and revealing experience with EXPOSED PARTY LAB: MOST LIKELY TO!<br><br>Uncover what your friends truly think about each other in this exciting and laughter-filled exposed party group games.<br><br>Discover who&#39;s up for the craziest dirty challenges in your friend group or couple with a number of different categories ranging from FAMILY, PARTY, COLLEAGUES to SPICY!<br><br>The game is simple. Add all your friends\u2019 names and wait for them to be EXPOSED!<br>Answer questions, do dares and complete challenges.<br>With a number of different categories ranging from cheeky, sexy to absurd! This game is sure to turn any time you spend with your friends super fun!<br>Say goodbye to the old fashioned games of spin the bottle, truth or dare, quizup and cards against humanity! We have more than 5000 challenges and questions so every game night of yours is fresh and fun!<br>To have a fun night with EXPOSED , all participants must download the app from the App Store. One player creates the game and invites their friends into the party with the game PIN. Whether you are physically together or connected remotely with friends, you can enjoy Exposed!<br><br>Party Lab offers an array of diverse categories, from humorous and daring to downright absurd! This guarantees an unforgettable time with your friends every time you play. With PARTY LAB&#39;s extensive collection of challenges and questions, every game night is a fresh and exhilarating experience as each round exposes new secrets and showcases the true nature of your friendships!<br><br>Now, we bring you even more to boom it:<br><br>- A fresh take on party games<br>- Over 7000 truths, dares, and challenges<br>- 5 adaptable game modes for different scenarios (party, spicy, family, dirty, kids, colleagues)<br>- Various game settings, including mixing categories, question count, timer, anonymous mode, and points-based victory<br>- An exceptional icebreaker and catalyst for fun interactions<br>- Perfect couple game<br><br>In the free mode, you only have access to the &quot;Get Started&quot; category with limited questions, and you are also restricted in the game settings. However, with a paid subscription, you gain full access to all categories and game settings without any limitations.<br><br>The game surpasses the enjoyment of classics like Exploding Kittens 2, Finger Chooser, Picolo, Evil Apples, Exposed, Boomit or Jeopardy.<br><br>Contact us partylab.app@gmail.com<br><br>https://www.partylab.app/TermsOfUse",
